### [@mastra/dynamodb@1.4.2](https://github.com/mastra-ai/mastra/blob/@mastra/dynamodb@1.4.2/stores/dynamodb/CHANGELOG.md)
#### Patch Changes

- Added run fencing for durable agents. DynamoDB stores now reject writes from a durable agent execution that lost its run to crash recovery, so it can't overwrite the recovered run's messages, threads, or workflow state (#23734). (#26423)

  Claims are stored as items in your existing table, so no table changes are needed. `storage.prune()` doesn't cover these items on DynamoDB yet, so they are kept.

