### [@mastra/react@1.10.0](https://github.com/mastra-ai/mastra/blob/@mastra/react@1.10.0/client-sdks/react/CHANGELOG.md)
#### Minor Changes

- `useCompareExperiments` now compares two to ten experiments at once. Pass `experimentIds` (and optionally `baselineId`) instead of `experimentIdA` and `experimentIdB`. The `options` parameter, which no longer had any fields, is removed. (#26725)

  ```ts
  // Before
  useCompareExperiments({ datasetId, experimentIdA: 'exp-1', experimentIdB: 'exp-2' });

  // After
  useCompareExperiments({ datasetId, experimentIds: ['exp-1', 'exp-2', 'exp-3'], baselineId: 'exp-1' });
